  "privacyPolicyDataCollectionTitle": "Data Collection",
  "privacyPolicyDataCollectionContent": "Skyward does not collect or upload your subscription URLs, node information, configuration content, visited websites, connection records, traffic content, or logs. All such data is stored only on your device and is never transmitted to the developer.\n\nThe app only accesses the network when you use features that require it, such as updating subscriptions (accessing the subscription URL you provided) or checking for updates (accessing GitHub).",
  "privacyPolicyDataUseTitle": "How We Use Data",
  "privacyPolicyDataUseContent": "All data stays on your device. We use it solely to provide the app's functionality: managing your proxy configurations, establishing VPN connections, and displaying network statistics. We do not use your data for advertising, analytics, or any other purpose.",
