  "privacyPolicyDataSharingContent": "We do not share, sell, or disclose your data to any third party. There are no analytics SDKs, crash reporting services, or advertising frameworks integrated into the app.",
  "privacyPolicyDataSecurityTitle": "Data Security",
  "privacyPolicyDataSecurityContent": "Your configuration and subscription data is stored in the app's private storage on your device, protected by the operating system's sandbox. Sensitive items such as the controller secret are stored in the system keystore where available.",
